menu "CAN bus (TWAI)"

    config APP_CAN_SELF_TEST
        bool "Bench mode (self test + loopback)"
        default y
        help
            The node needs no ACK and receives its own frames back, so it works with no
            other node on the bus. It still needs its transceiver: on the ESP32-S3 the
            frame comes back through the RX pin, read from the bus, not by an internal
            route. Without a transceiver nothing comes back and "CAN bus not connected"
            is reported once. Turn it off on the real bus, where another node provides
            the ACK.

endmenu
